5
Display the employees who have the same DEPTNO and MGR of a given
employee, excluding that employee.
(Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, DEPTNO, MGR
     FROM EMP
     WHERE (DEPTNO, MGR) =
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO, MGR
         FROM EMP
         WHERE ENAME = 'ALLEN'
     )
     AND ENAME <> 'ALLEN';

